        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ov-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope and modeling rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• One clinic branch; exactly one current room per department.&lt;br/&gt;• A visit may contain several services from the same department.&lt;br/&gt;• Doctor, room and required-device availability is checked atomically.&lt;br/&gt;• Booking/package prices and discounts are stored as historical snapshots.&lt;br/&gt;• Payments, refunds, shift movements and audit events are append-only.&lt;br/&gt;• Offline mode is read-only; it never creates a synchronization queue.&lt;br/&gt;• Every *ByUserId / *UserId field references ApplicationUser unless a composite FK is shown.&lt;br/&gt;• AK = alternate unique key, CK = check constraint, ? = nullable." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2937;dashed=1;fillColor=#fffdf2;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.3;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1530" y="120" width="500" height="440"/>
        </mxCell>
